{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359900/extras/fcf1aa67cde37e824b5cbd7f478dc124.avif?t=1769414018\" width=1280 height=264 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REAL BOUT FATAL FURY 2: THE NEWCOMERS, the fighting game that first appeared in arcades back in 1998, makes its debut on Steam\u2014with added online features and other fresh new features!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>While preserving the original graphics and gameplay, the game now includes rollback netcode for smooth online matches.</strong><br><strong>Challenge players around the world in the highest-quality version of REAL BOUT FATAL FURY 2 ever!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 The largest roster in Fatal Fury series history\u201423 characters!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In addition to fan favorites like Terry Bogard and Mai Shiranui, the two titular newcomers Li Xiangfei and Rick Strowd join the fight! Including the hidden playable character Alfred, a total of 23 fighters are ready to rumble!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359900/extras/774d79d016efb9566b3923f069336edd.avif?t=1769414018\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359900/extras_big/774d79d016efb9566b3923f069336edd.avif?t=1769414018 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Smooth and exciting online matches!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The new rollback netcode ensures responsive and competitive online play. With a lobby system that supports up to 9 players and multiple tournament formats, such as single match, double elimination, and league play, the definitive RB2 online experience has arrived.</strong><br><strong>Time to bring the intense mind games of the perfected Line Sway system to online!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359900/extras/18a40b2c9eeeb2e7934c69d7e4e47504.avif?t=1769414018\" width=1280 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 New features abound for REAL BOUT FATAL FURY 2!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy the new Gallery Mode with 59 pieces of artwork, including key art and character illustrations! </strong><br><strong>Unlock achievements that let you use your favorites as an online avatar!</strong><br><strong>Practice Mode has also been enhanced with adjustable game speed and hitbox display features.</strong><br><strong>This version is packed with new features to give you the definitive REAL BOUT FATAL FURY 2 experience!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359900/extras/fa1ee73c34246db9d7c2b54fbd142ef8.avif?t=1769414018\" width=1280 height=264 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The New Ruler of South Town","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3359900/4c4c6d3b104704ceaf84e2b2bbdca79b136f760c.jpg"},{"name":"The New Emperor of Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3359900/c248a938842f52ba8c4fc618f61a69d210a61e0c.jpg"},{"name":"Spread Your Wings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3359900/2434272dc467df019f16e32aebb035f30810d598.jpg"},{"name":"Dance Duck Dance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3359900/d709ae02d17a61e5701f9cea933e430a52f7af28.jpg"},{"name":"Absolute Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3359900/a8edecfc3e4680c4fffa54345ab319a931